152
00:06:45,827 --> 00:06:48,379
And now we see node 2 is removed

153
00:06:49,118 --> 00:06:49,968
and therefore

154
00:06:50,643 --> 00:06:53,676
3 has no active connections and 1 only

155
00:06:53,708 --> 00:06:54,591
